# ---- Third-party reference copies ------------------------------------------
# Nothing third-party is redistributed here, including CC-BY material.
# Only the README pointer of each vendor folder is tracked; the copies are
# fetched locally by whoever needs them. A new vendor folder is excluded by
# default, so the safe direction is the automatic one.
previous-project-result/**/vendor/**
!previous-project-result/**/vendor/**/
!previous-project-result/**/vendor/**/README.md
previous-project-result/01-mspdi/mspdi/*
!previous-project-result/01-mspdi/mspdi/README.md
previous-project-result/05-security-a11y/wcag/*
!previous-project-result/05-security-a11y/wcag/README.md

# ---- Internal working notes. Never published. ----
previous-project-result/temp/

